- Review all existing changes and uncommitted files.
- Fix malformed text and encoding artifacts in the UI.
- Remove misleading claims and placeholder statuses.
- Resolve deprecations that affect security or reliability.
- Audit migrations 0000 through the latest migration.
- Confirm migration timestamps are monotonic.
- Confirm migrations replay safely on a new database.
- Add missing indexes, foreign keys, checks, RLS policies, triggers, and relations.
- Review voice-test session recovery and cleanup behavior.
- Ensure API/web/worker shutdown is clean.
- Improve error responses without exposing credentials or provider payloads.
- Update README and environment templates accurately.

## Milestone 2: Complete the product UI

Create a polished, responsive, accessible business dashboard.

Required pages:

- Public landing page
- Pricing/explanation page if pricing is approved
- Sign-in and sign-up
- Onboarding
- Dashboard overview
- Agents list
- Agent create/edit/test/history
