- Structured summary.
- Qualification score from 1 to 10.
- Hot/warm/cold classification.
- Captured fields.
- Objections.
- Follow-up action.
- Evidence references for important extracted conclusions.

Post-call analysis must:

- Use a versioned structured schema.
- Never invent missing information.
- Distinguish facts stated by the caller from model inference.
- Be retryable and idempotent.
- Not block settlement.
- Allow human correction with an audit trail.

